abstract: >-
  Check whether eBPF reject diagnostics still name the injection line after
  pad and rename stress. Markers are set at construction time. Scoring covers
  SourceComment-style heuristics and related baselines on PointerProvenance,
  ScalarRange, NullablePointer, and PacketBounds templates. This does not
  claim a machine-verified semantic proof-loss oracle.
keywords:
  - eBPF
  - verifier
  - diagnostic localization
  - metamorphic testing
  - bpfix
  - software testing
